    },
    "jigoku_token": null,
    "token": "ラケージ",
    "basis": "settled 2026-10-02 from fresh-translation review: Refers to herself as the great pirate Lukkage (this Lukkage), ojou-sama speech, Yunboro, Gargantia pirates; Jigoku had no identification"
  },
  "lines": {
    "272:0": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b50478befabc7d643e44e3f4dea608048cc4b80146df48401f0c770689dcb862",
      "en": "「I, $$ラケージ$$, shall be your opponent.\\nConsider it an honor.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:67": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "002a5c6b8e5f4f3ce073e540314c2dddd4b4a57c58613f8d349013b5cd5a3d29",
      "en": "「I never let marked prey get away.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:100": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5f1fbc416ad2c50dc6750b77f8269956f6dd20e6dd6773930939900c855317b0",
      "en": "「That's the price of underrating me.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:135": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9870701342629ef433570fdecda5cc9efea51700e6466350c66bcfb2a30462bd",
      "en": "「Hehehehe... This is getting fun.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:176": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "34aad5e4f916f9dcbe0822730aecc860621fb40a606090def93c9d87a3e9f1e2",
      "en": "「Being my target was your bad luck.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:211": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a8f8860c3d78962da57caae798bd03d418800a81a7f7ba88058ab4bd70ffe696",
      "en": "「Run if you don't want to die.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:254": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5dd029196bbd0abadcbdbe37347ffd1e21613c8c77c4b92d6122897a84d98c83",
      "en": "「Are you prepared to go down?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:289": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "092ca5379b161fac92c585c5533a31aef84fec2f6724603fb437f2754aec3cfa",
      "en": "「Think you can beat great pirate $$ラケージ$$?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:332": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "36fcabcbdefa91daf254e0ecfd5db7d461872176b8ad28f8c0b06a7e5ce5d1ff",
      "en": "「There you are!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:351": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9d05feb46ec58e03ddccac95586a05d7b68855c66731ee86e337fe9defdca9ed",
      "en": "「This one will sting!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:376": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "05b18ecc3a56401f1bf504d831be76526fc1bd6dfffc4fd29252eef3c8c49af3",
      "en": "「There's no escaping!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:405": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4ace61fb9ea256a279f8cd3a96bcd7d84f1c7a0fb242292fa88d48a2b7191595",
      "en": "「How about this!?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:430": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "74bd45ea4444cd408cc9917dead979f59cfaebdf3401f92bbd6b87a51fff337c",
      "en": "「I show no mercy!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:453": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "96921a2d141d8c66fe1c7c02011a63b6854862d264731162b43ffdd6a1a6b108",
      "en": "「Be torn to shreds!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:480": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b05f6ed7787e8e3ab79178b62fa77a968989d54e55de853decb4d7afb01f7e8c",
      "en": "「I'll swat you down with ease!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:513": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0f6c3275637396be70caf77ee12bee28267ed0c443c79667cc7455ed58f145b6",
      "en": "「Out of my way!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:538": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6a3c75cdb35817d1a7b14d70cbf23b150dcc292543448b37102624b010d6eea4",
      "en": "「It's useless to hope for mercy!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:573": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "db82bf01fb8b2d3343fcfca354fb874a37740ed9d579db6b1ba1f3b697e5e7e2",
      "en": "「Hmph... how vulgar!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:598": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4eb4e9009c2de83aa661dfdc84365281f921e9420ed67d2643595318cd9210d8",
      "en": "「Oh my, how unseemly of me.\\nPardon me!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:647": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6db9d68e8035425d533e615e1022837d5096fcdd204b60bcd6c0be6757c0e223",
      "en": "「I have the advantage underwater!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:676": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b1c2d09c6c475e0ddd90ddeb65b4dcdecde03a0e5c5ef4e2ea5a85c0393560ae",
      "en": "「Now, how will you fare in water?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:709": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "67874ef66b5f963b7588707c723d5b68af6a12d7a2b6f7c7d3145d069d53e8d7",
      "en": "「Hehe, I can see you perfectly.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:734": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dfcfbc13834d9d11e72af28d1896f75ba65fda12d8dbe16ff319e3c35d58e07e",
      "en": "「I'll blow you away!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:763": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3217f742562b887cf90740db72947ffee7e796d25e4e6d5a4fa94123458b37bf",
      "en": "「I'll turn you into a beehive!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:798": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "85d63eb2754bd0f2b6b57ce48ff1c56ff1cfecda6192d90184657dd391f8187c",
      "en": "「I'll pump you full of shots!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:833": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a7ea0aace4e07ea515eba68ef302eeb6f42f38b675a1789cb2cda3499e9097b8",
      "en": "「Become scrap metal!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:864": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9df59316dc17c295ad0eef50888e186d3760e355a0b546c7ef309a28b34af552",
      "en": "「I'll show you the power gap!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:903": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "24ec00a1abda796d07776e8d88f618de7244d59a632fa44308e8bd79d78680cb",
      "en": "「I'll crush you flat!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:938": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c5be629ae49c9da1c2ecb3fce2a58aa0bc6b0d03e9885175e09479a9fb8fa5f6",
      "en": "「I'll pamper you nice and slow!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_02"
    },
    "272:975": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "be19f66a39a25a66afbea6534546b982e4717cfb03fe74ec71bc9fca777a83c0",
      "en": "「Too bad,\\nit isn't over yet!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1026": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e14dc2ff15af009da6aa74a25cb8f2f2eaef0598cc5ab878def5bb33032afe21",
      "en": "「It's too soon to feel safe!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1053": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "06864137b140aa1b648e6532840850de6cf9550d28d346ee6eb00f0f39b4e266",
      "en": "「You're not the only one\\nwith a special $$ユンボロ$$!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1112": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "edc63654a4267d30753afe6350a193c09bd56a2dfca45931d8b8e8758719c01c",
      "en": "「With my skill,\\na $$ユンボロ$$ like that is nothing!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1163": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5c3b217635db463b6ee92f28a3f088aff784410dc3dc69c387170f7342e8ec75",
      "en": "「A pirate doesn't fear a $$クジライカ$$!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1202": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3568e126d409e977cf88a9ae036f3ad3ed19c2f94904c3752d05d80f42eac04e",
      "en": "「Honestly! What a creepy opponent!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1243": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "21ab4c45d9f3c13524fcc9963ad8b6e78fae936a951de590d1e81b581fb3a697",
      "en": "「Shall we go hunt space $$クジライカ$$?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1282": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d5a59ccd8ec0bc46097024da9cd873b74bc36095746e8e3906118804894d1749",
      "en": "「I'll sink you, fleet and all!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1317": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "22d025e59bf5d91d91de8ce435af5669455dadf6b4e272f1b5a4b473e6e27524",
      "en": "「Let's finish this fast and get back\\nto the pirate trade!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1368": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4f0a79cee8220c067ae8a3e8c02b95b351a9fda02d8585003f0704afff1aa5b2",
      "en": "「I'll break your broken machine\\neven further!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1421": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b2e34eeb97d061fb0be2ca6936f002389015f176c33bb600fac31652507c100d",
      "en": "「Prosperity and peace are things\\nyou seize with your own hands!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1472": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c4f8945c1f8d7f0613544b35afe7f4bda88c96675a89d85e795784b0da9dd697",
      "en": "「How about a contest of power?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1507": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "96b4e6678908575b9e8f231e952c081e2769a5dd70deec96f894472bf8cb3c1f",
      "en": "「What a pesky $$ユンボロ$$, darting about!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1550": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b841c1537353192e2fe19f6265c02ec0367ce7f9c29d01aa4e16d3e27b3e2105",
      "en": "「Can you match my $$ユンボロ$$'s power?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1591": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fe01f88d50d03118ca8dfc7e9cba14d13b62581d7eaff66f382c92bac0ee5833",
      "en": "「You're big, so you're easy to hit.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1630": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "56dd88c4a158ba96eab09ef150760520325f11a1bf9ef0e92fb9c63b4b53a90b",
      "en": "「Hehe, that color...\\nI don't mind your taste.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1681": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "29d062b46477cd00c2a094ef7f277d3156ea9eced6208bdfddd22825a6928000",
      "en": "「I'm called an Empress too...\\nI won't fall behind.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1740": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d0314d06f2e5f8f6c1449eabe0d89f652a77daccff44b07e948ba8fd30876f9a",
      "en": "「A $$ガンダム$$ Yunboro, is it...\\nWorth the trouble of taking down!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1799": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ecf0507b94c889d6c737d7914f27870656656eeaedd2fac751e8dcc9370212d8",
      "en": "「Unlike the space boy's $$ユンボロ$$,\\ndon't you talk?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1852": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8a6606ead13a385cda67c773b027f0c65e2b87034832f0b141f58c6ee7c3a316",
      "en": "「I'll scrap you as a souvenir\\nfor $$ピニオン$$.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1909": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8bd97035362d5a4eeb997f4b17b56d7cac2e29134d8e127649592b6d51858e1e",
      "en": "「Kindly go back beyond the stars!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:1942": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "cb08f6446274e0415d6b0906235cca3c3fd20ed638d68a1b08b9eef14da79e2c",
      "en": "「Since you came all this way,\\nI must show you hospitality...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2003": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "08a38a6c95ef49df4097e86ec7b65ab3476fb3ff3365cf966941a4cc0102fa83",
      "en": "「I don't like creatures like this.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2046": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d95e7edcfa5e66f51c4c66facd87b7fe758396837705200db17c1c89e7a35305",
      "en": "「No need to hold back on a monster!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2083": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "739d945f063866866bcd894ba782fd1a79a9815aac951c12d5ce76c0f97656b7",
      "en": "「Attacking you doesn't much\\nappeal to me...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2140": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dcc12ec3c6aac603fea61d0c749245cd639274360732413787272c41cd9423a5",
      "en": "「If you surrender,\\nI might let you go!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2191": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d991c5811ac49180c7aa2598d2a9b97ffc85be6fb75ad01505ec17cf38ffecf7",
      "en": "「What treasures are loaded\\non that ship, I wonder?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2244": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dfe38ff1abef100aab1f91dc85220ab5e4e46b887b46feca9c3cf5885e260fbe",
      "en": "「Crush their head, and\\nthe victory is ours.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2303": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c0b42a8be54371936ee9af752defa84ca4e7a04a934d60ef4291ec7e8422556e",
      "en": "「Quite a tough-looking opponent!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2344": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c76a8c3bc82c955f8ba142f43189ae5fcabe7826c7f0c671a5cca3cda5d0510a",
      "en": "「Your days of throwing your weight\\naround end here!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2393": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ad20f13804d7309a9bb67470d73fe48968557221ae28a93d5a62f8b9c6e964a0",
      "en": "「$$サイデリアル$$!\\nGet off Earth this instant!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2448": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f855fafd13636b73d3d0391ce59238c3c103560409f19330d20fc8e75d2ea59c",
      "en": "「That arrogance... I dislike it...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2491": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "38728be1384aee770248f9c9ff879d2f0c71ac8493f5ae654db239230aa1b41f",
      "en": "「Now then, let's take back\\nwhat was taken from us!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2540": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "37d704e553ff12cee4db56475cd2d8583c48b5b6c304219818ba7087e3193ec1",
      "en": "「Your treasure...\\nI shall take it from you!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2589": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9c849f5e3e0889516a5a83b8f2176794dbdaa5af28b2578007be7371461b60ea",
      "en": "「The power of this Sphere...!\\nI won't let you use it!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2638": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "aa9f11c294f4e4febe70203aa819d55d515a1ffff6b8c4ad87b1f2f08cbebe92",
      "en": "「Think you can have your way with\\nhumanity? You're sorely mistaken!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2695": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5a54f92f8307d85071c35e3a4e31a42abf9255c4b931ab3ff5bd23075772bec2",
      "en": "「Playing at being a god...!\\nI loathe it to my core!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2754": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ede19aeec0705da2b47725d1bafe1d6bc6c61d51ca8a92a94c2c1d3e2dd6e712",
      "en": "「Behave like the servant you are\\nand stay quiet!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2805": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a85e24c9e632c4e034161975216d38e3b0dd8cf576b1af439cc3dfb7027b5518",
      "en": "「Small fry who can do nothing\\nwithout an $$御使い$$ backing them...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2860": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fe63ef7fb30b83eeb32738f531a9dc3b81a8013808b5058b41018ef9fdef3429",
      "en": "「Regrets come too late!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2885": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fa8197a8ddfb07f5312dd956f87584eccf789338b6e5099f96836df846422fbb",
      "en": "「As you wish, I'll be your opponent!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2926": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2a414269da2d275a3669413c57572c6faca3b17f008fc1e612fe108894a4ffe0",
      "en": "「Time for your punishment!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2953": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0a525eaac618c2349e0e8af2da593bd58a355a6951c1b8d7e190458ca433d059",
      "en": "「Hehe, the prey is caught in my net.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:2990": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8415570442dcd6472de57495c7cc771eea8a2dc098405eaa3c847bf89c8c3092",
      "en": "「Come now! I'll strike back too!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3027": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ad511b2224cc72c612bfb71c89e9d54dd3903b6f655ed614e6a0514bd18a2b93",
      "en": "「What a reckless fool we have here!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3066": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "cae93ac381a6b89648e2623dad124aeeed32e8bf4ca446f04a03dcd1b48ed0b5",
      "en": "「I'll repay every hit you landed!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3109": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "b3f3376f837b606b90be44c992b4f7bffcdf416511d720c0833f55ed5810f8fa",
      "en": "「Now it's my turn to come at you!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3144": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d148cd049b9a9a442794d4895d7bcf9cddc6a987166e36305cb6557c2069e6b1",
      "en": "「I won't take a beating quietly!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3187": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "db46c989ca0db9cce8be0d6baea4bcd770850dd5b2a8427463232b595b1d8ffc",
      "en": "「I, $$ラケージ$$, will handle the rest.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3222": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2e6c5c11f833de11ca8e8c015e27e87633cacb19f59a09864255bbf480537550",
      "en": "「Pardon me for coming from behind.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3247": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "20bef4380ce44904a5467fd6bc1a184220f1f1fd1d49b47058986e867ed72b03",
      "en": "「I might lend you a hand.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3280": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c785ebcd4360a80431bbfd6c5634116ab06a23bfd17736ada095f8edc1c1dd0a",
      "en": "「Troubling great pirate $$ラケージ$$, hm?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3323": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "02d854afcc1e209c605e53d597caae33292f7a32717a762eff0178bceba35968",
      "en": "「My subordinate's mess...\\nI'll settle it myself.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3370": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e10da71865495b3a30ffd760fc2ab230aedc0529f9cb51656343bf53d6afeca5",
      "en": "「$$レド$$, do bring them down properly!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3409": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "51a67149c0aa58d29ffd85f45ae882baac776f7f1d426dd7a9fa8a5e6790b1b5",
      "en": "「Your finish is sloppy, space boy!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3440": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "97a0f17e2f686c250e777c2a6fcca0e9493396840bb25fee247a794963fd3746",
      "en": "「I can't very well abandon you.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3475": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "74f8b713234eb60fb9a629dbab036313b61374084f86763ac5c3ae059ddde2c8",
      "en": "「I do look after my own, you know.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3510": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fe5157df26c99d28a38ba76a26d4c32135a90291b27c3e4f82e6a85c2c7abfc2",
      "en": "「I get it. Fall back!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3553": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f9cfc26dabc33382266acd5345e4ac943071f339ac99a60e7a0c12d8bda8a5e1",
      "en": "「$$レド$$, you owe me for this.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3592": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "bdf391cc8ad55e8436c4f331ff5aded0dd2aec0d596db813ae0982f4bc43ec1b",
      "en": "「$$レド$$! You're being targeted!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3623": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4866bfedb1aab532bd860edd7271f14294c42a00a5981fdd3755bc5f3706abf5",
      "en": "「Leave the enemies in front\\nto me!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3674": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c80f14e660609574423251fa8b5d350763769bb1a7972d87d4fbdbc2e94fcfbf",
      "en": "「I'd do that without being told!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3707": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5eed085ecc60bbea38eef527639467b8829e2b2dc2afe76292f17acb1281b9ea",
      "en": "「Unlucky for you to face me...」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3736": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e6732d4088a631dd7874492c7a072c1d67777c9a14827ccf3b548efb9ce0bffb",
      "en": "「I shall be your opponent.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3777": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1bb33f4533904a9c13c02580a3fc7d61d4a0ccb6b831d9a83a36fbccbfab3df7",
      "en": "「Then, I'll go first!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3796": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "825cb60ca0290d4cdac8a174d35c4520582e6805e9abfda8b4db85baad494b09",
      "en": "「Allow me to strike first!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3835": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0b1bae7d15ae9213ca10e62f5916019462fc0bb239302079343ee664e98cc360",
      "en": "「Forget harassing, I'll finish them!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3876": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "88216c966618cfaa6938d248c23343aeedc98ade31cdae820e88d5fdd676dc0b",
      "en": "「Wouldn't I be enough by myself?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:3905": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a0b18d19485ab089f193484d8004ed87a1c6ada15395df933c186b34319db350",
      "en": "「You dare make a fool of me!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3940": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "9a62c29197325bd813aa3419b80be27ac6cdd89c8a3ebdbd18251b79a5a9f0ba",
      "en": "「Are you really that afraid of me?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:3973": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "aac4311c6bd33830316d06b1fb960fed7788110d184f3303d87da7953036905c",
      "en": "「Me, attacked so one-sidedly...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4016": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f5eeb46a24075d6609e7f1e1459060ca700b5de8069c659595ccb5d91426d8e3",
      "en": "「Stop being scared and\\ncome closer.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4067": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f497990af7b64bbce311b938c1b8e5268fc78ab34d3e8aa8e709e60b13731d89",
      "en": "「You do play cheap tricks...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4104": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d1bf6d7cbd95fe7892d12f6b658fe70af3d1558d10431a061a1bd2ae05d16592",
      "en": "「I wasted too many shots...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4137": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e907c9f7b20ccebe29655185d31c641e23e0fa362c2a8413781b6b1973c160cb",
      "en": "「Hurry the resupply preparations!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4166": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "df5be298767d07120e9348a99d6b9d902e4bcfa85452d5183adc5c739c002948",
      "en": "「What a clumsy attack.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4187": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "933d2475af62ae0a199efee0dd84aaacbcbca7270ed7b9d01c989f85f48a208d",
      "en": "「Oh? What are you up to?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4218": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "164925f7a47f04e207842e9db78c55722edbcc54992f539e98e201fcea603fef",
      "en": "「Heh, now you're playing along.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4245": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c6c56324301736e768346d942a6d2fe4cf3df24c639982c98414578ae278809a",
      "en": "「You're not worth talking to.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4280": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0b62442445299b1979e4a7533f6c68dcf85d4886e286e683e4fb9387b1ef98ca",
      "en": "「Where are you aiming?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4311": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "99ad95542a03c9fec85e2c27ed813605f7e66f385d738b0fb7c5a5dc52475469",
      "en": "「Too scared to attack properly?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4352": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3ea91b4c3ced66a79e1c485d364cbc77ffaae8b34425d42505adb2ba0dd2c9f1",
      "en": "「Next time, check your aim properly.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4393": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f1a465ad70a38bd024ae650d6637f67ccd9ef7bd044043d945dc9fa9fbf11ef9",
      "en": "「The name 'wave-riding lobster'\\nisn't just for show.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4448": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f19d7b7c5e40dddd9ac693cdcf928b88ac9cfd94dea4590409bc5f6e10141857",
      "en": "「That would make a fine $$ユンボロ$$\\nweep.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4513": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5bef53f7a85c853f4d860613d4de3e50a20ac8e29864a50ca78c56f5cd30cc41",
      "en": "「I'm ashamed I got heated\\nover an opponent like this.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4578": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5fa4ceeb647b45d5b4571b21f878ea1241c298bcca187c3ffd2d2b61594776de",
      "en": "「The $$ユンボロ$$ of the outside world\\nare nothing special either.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4635": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4a603a0402167955ef483cee07a16c800ef11521d71748d4a0e0adffca0c87f0",
      "en": "「Never heard of great pirate $$ラケージ$$?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4678": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "852a9e7622e0c4a0f08993cdef1b213961028f4972e14360f2853bd37d013aaa",
      "en": "「Half of what $$レド$$ claimed...\\nno, even less than that.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4729": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e8a2fbe76dce5552dfc3b245fc83927e729551d86079cc500bc872099c1adecd",
      "en": "「Space monsters are no match for me.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4770": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ea19deb73b0154eef0f6a94b490a5201be8a35093ceba9761ed391c23ff9d9cb",
      "en": "「Looks like you're all bluster.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4803": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e5dcedb63ba54446a6d8aa2a1ea65078ab630155ef8dc5a0863138f0bd08c8b9",
      "en": "「Your words lack the strength.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4838": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6caf1a5bd41127c85c23b3148d85539232223e6429454e9178525b4799c7097b",
      "en": "「Hollow, just like your insides.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4877": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5e901c8ac59fe95324c2f20a25b63d289e3f51238dee1aa622adc9edb6087930",
      "en": "「Calling yourself a god with this?\\nYou make me laugh.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4928": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "664c6b4d8c9c0561f63774616ebc195eb27c1b5578cdd653395b03dd4b55a5ca",
      "en": "「What a convenient feature.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4951": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "781adebd6c3d23212d740afa94264e6b2fdecf09775e15cfded9d595336f4f6b",
      "en": "「Heh, too bad.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:4976": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c667a66fdb98421c39cd9f017c3cc49bd56537b221d074ecacf7f14a6b0d6196",
      "en": "「Surprised? I have gear like this.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5017": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f6a0ccc5af45f6fb1932e7e5a22d11641fa214b0d3cb46bd5b251cb47ccd09ac",
      "en": "「You're no match for me.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5048": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2e230177702b503658ad57cfcba3dbfc16a3c819f3a533e816e397618b811dd7",
      "en": "「What a dull opponent.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5075": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "bb5f0dd6a3aeb7b0d11432f916f9c765cf47c9b19a0a7bc8f4f33b3fab619fc8",
      "en": "「No need to hold back, you know?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5108": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "cf4bf792ad55dfd1e12c0e2a2cf891141b8b91fb1c1a527fdef01369836f4e6c",
      "en": "「Seems you're a hundred years\\ntoo early to challenge me.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5159": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ab1c00ff6f9163f7ccce40bfc31b64bec049caa17aa0282fc471519060cfd5c3",
      "en": "「It doesn't hurt in the slightest.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5194": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "104d5fe44de095b538c90fb408fc843a3866374da068edfc7621f56147a56d52",
      "en": "「Is that the best attack you have?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5225": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a677ea982c15593173f08cfbd9b6f32cd9aa5a65df0cbbb41f40e8bc26776555",
      "en": "「All show, and then some.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5258": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5ef11eeffbb41e41a11c589c7c3dd36669c159e7a155776c2fb784ef40a2cb0e",
      "en": "「I'll grant you the courage\\nto challenge me, at least.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5315": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "93652907bf6816b132b25ca2aa64c71897dbfaf38d2cb6f72298af0d97c048eb",
      "en": "「Heh, you're better than I expected.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5344": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8f2910a402a7e74265270bf8a9795fecd14129f430c068ec09708c318923ec2a",
      "en": "「Pushy... I don't dislike it.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5375": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "989705fbb46ff01a0098cbf14ab7f7a554bb2a1cd326c89acb0118730e3846fa",
      "en": "「You may entertain me a little.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5414": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5f7a7f1e41e4eb6d028cd5a4e932aed36f8e927ed37d1f9abbdf1f176d4a2287",
      "en": "「Your skill is real, I see!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5443": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "41428a6e7257765341ec9cb090a7619e3c359059c857f05cd848069d2b284533",
      "en": "「That one... actually hurt!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5472": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "c1f560a79986524cb8d7100e39a6b83ffc896e4be422f36801d821736291d539",
      "en": "「Very well... now it truly begins!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5509": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "e530d6119ddc2260c04eb0c0899947bcc4e742c113278b4582a3dbb8bbf3ef96",
      "en": "「You'll pay dearly for this!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5542": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a6a984dae0445c61ec8056d3008cb74e7b346d9e23c6edc85796c8a01772a3e9",
      "en": "「You dare make\\na fool of me...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5591": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "2868303c0b58333c9ea0586792378ae74055fcb6565588b737d769494bca6fb3",
      "en": "「Raising a hand to a lady?\\nHow terribly rude.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5652": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f9ed765223b8e463b46c9ed08651d8f0e841c90042048a9985f6fa9ab2280a87",
      "en": "「Gah! What is that $$ユンボロ$$!?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5687": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "44aab29ffa27398aa94075e0cf975e05cc62bfa1dbd03b7ac47a9109b003b746",
      "en": "「That $$ユンボロ$$...!\\nIt's no ordinary one!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5738": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ed6ca1c5b11dcbf6a6c7550b8a33cff5db06c9f1dea7777a9c8d6720618f110b",
      "en": "「These guys...!\\nThey don't fear $$ラケージ$$ one bit!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5795": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "770ef744e6d3b3c97ddeab94ade30e2a637bcd9548f80e33d6dfc3cf3b648f65",
      "en": "「To think the outside world has\\nsuch a powerful $$ユンボロ$$...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5854": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0e4988773a5ffed87ed4a754e7f4296c7d41b4f038c406c90de569739c24b0dc",
      "en": "「To think such a monster exists\\nin this world...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5905": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "dd6992aef19fb5c41ec8d84fc4ab25e1bf6c8d91ba6f82c15080a8536f5a5783",
      "en": "「I refuse to be destroyed\\nby the likes of you...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:5954": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5e081afae2675c015e850292610bf08aa4fbeffba2683c82e215f8c43c65a273",
      "en": "「I don't fear the likes of this!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:5993": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "6d1fbed1408dc5fa0994d834f20fb831c25bd664b52c9db20cd471977020ec03",
      "en": "「Even if I die, I will never submit!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6036": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "f68d5c970f0442ad0c4ec6ed93edc9b271b08571b2bc5878ae89a9f73908d7ae",
      "en": "「You tin can hussy!\\nDon't get above yourself!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6087": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "18e88cc01c1fa0926b50e738e02c43cc250b93256296794bc2edb0b6a1571328",
      "en": "「The repose you speak of?\\nNo, thank you!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6146": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "0da9a6dce49a559fb36292165ea4edd96297a8a100cbe2708710bae8ed96a984",
      "en": "「Ngh! So this is the crucial moment!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6189": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "d803bddcefa2070bee9e6aa289398d557a5bbeb835efd6ab2b8c25aa728476a6",
      "en": "「Never thought I'd lose this badly!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6230": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "617c2c51ac9b73cf74d88adfb7276f0a600ef139f8d75e326fa79eb7bd0be49a",
      "en": "「I, $$ラケージ$$, will never\\nsurrender, even if I die!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6291": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "fa37ecdafb4b447bcf428dddb9919d66831fad723f8ca75ee8dc3ca324abeb2f",
      "en": "「The match isn't over yet...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6328": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a8552e7fb8858abc32d073bde3979e287b55ba2255047bdc70a7e518422bb9e7",
      "en": "「Eeeek!\\n...I-I screamed without meaning to!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6387": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "255045ebd11fb7b9c94e3f90aaa4b35c4dc37a34ce2db611b429a77395f978af",
      "en": "「Things have become a bit\\ntroublesome...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6438": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "8e638e15095cb717b3ab3b819a0bbf765b3a8f8e4953e8e5567f7d12153e196b",
      "en": "「Don't think my life can be\\ntaken so easily!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6493": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "3e7af54436c46dc522d5e39ca0a9b8081c7e763dffbcc86b456c2c49d09c825a",
      "en": "「Falling here would set a poor\\nexample for my minions!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6556": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "1c50ba1405357b6e2b24992f4740dd7464d9e2a47430d2d6d956efc9d6035bdc",
      "en": "「Losing here would make\\nthe great pirate's name weep!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6605": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "4fa19c5e4d45743a5aa7ae7d84a461cdbb558a63dcb6137d809b51420a0fca93",
      "en": "「I was beaten!? I, $$ラケージ$$!?」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:6642": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "5344ad508d9245d14338a425572dcdf832a4bc0068c54e8eea63a3cbbfaba8bb",
      "en": "「How infuriating...!\\nTo think I'd come to this...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:6691": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "52dce47218477a4876464e0c6620d995cabae84567462b559024bc3c54bc4957",
      "en": "「I've lost all face over this...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_00"
    },
    "272:6724": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "246b53633dd26a93284969b78a4b01ee34cc100b97047f9ae102f753ca54ad6c",
      "en": "「So you're pausing the game.\\nHeh, what a fine opportunity.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6793": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "bd440190660b6e82ef31e3eea69424b60d2900c2e97fb883c432bf9f0d2a788c",
      "en": "「While you're away from SRW, I can pirate in peace. Let's rake in all we can in this gap.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:6912": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "934f4c19b799f930573d4ef5cd2b15e5dc803d89e3a3ffc710b5016c40af810d",
      "en": "「If you dislike that, hurry back. Not that I care whether you can stop me even if you do.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    },
    "272:7029": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "a243698dab3255ad5163c8db9e5032dcfd46a4de590b92666aa5ce7659332593",
      "en": "「Now then, have a nice long rest.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g272_01"
    }
  }
}
